# Local chat model for `fleet-chat`: qwen3:8b with a bigger context window.
#
# Ollama runs models with a 4096-token context by default, and its OpenAI-compatible
# API (used by Pydantic AI) ignores per-request `num_ctx`.  8 tool schemas plus a few
# tool results do not fit in 4096 tokens; Ollama would silently drop the beginning of
# the conversation, including the instructions.  This derived model shares the
# weights of qwen3:8b (no extra download), only the default context changes.
#
# Create once:  ollama create fleet-qwen3 -f Modelfile
#
# 12288 is a trade-off for an 8 GB GPU: measured on an RTX 4070 Laptop, 15 % of the
# model then runs on the CPU (4096: 0 %, 16384: 22 %).  More VRAM -> raise it.
FROM qwen3:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 12288
